yle=\"text-align: center\">CLEAR THE LEVEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/294c6dbbe6098cc0334a33797355522b.poster.avif?t=1772749853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/294c6dbbe6098cc0334a33797355522b.webm?t=1772749853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716650/extras/294c6dbbe6098cc0334a33797355522b.mp4?t=1772749853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Kill the Virus Boss at the end of the level to progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPEAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through levels to unlock new enemies and gather more data.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying Incremental progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple resources to collect</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive upgrade tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of unique weapons and droppable powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, satisfying gameplay</p></li></ul>",
